`items batch` packs the open XS and S items in id order: OI-0003 (M) and OI-0008 (unsized)
take the plan route, OI-0005 is in `clarify`, waiting on the user. With the cap at 7 SP the first
batch takes 1 + 2 + 2 + 2 = 7; OI-0007 (1 SP) would make 8, so it starts the second batch.

